        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Terraform commands aur unse banne wali files&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 terraform init &lt;br&gt; kya krta h  - &lt;/b&gt;1 Providers download karta h&lt;br&gt;2 Project initialize karta h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kya banta h - &lt;/b&gt;1 .terraform/ (folder)&lt;br&gt;2 .terraform.lock.hcl (file)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2 terraform validate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Koi file create nahi hoti&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kya karta h -&lt;/b&gt; 1 .tf file ka syntax check karta h&lt;br&gt;2 Error hai ya nahi batata h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 terraform plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kya karta h -&lt;/b&gt;  1 Batata hai kya create/update/delete hoga&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kya banta h -&lt;/b&gt; 1 Normally&lt;b&gt; koi file nahi banti&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2 (Optional) agar tum command use karo&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4 terraform apply&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kya karta h -&lt;/b&gt; 1 Kya karta h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kya banta h -&lt;/b&gt; 1 terraform.tfstate (main state file)&lt;br&gt;2 terraform.tfstate.backup (backup file)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&#xa;Terraform commands aur unse banne wali files&#xa;1 terraform init &#xa; kya krta h  - 1 Providers download karta h&#xa;2 Project initialize karta h&#xa;Kya banta h - 1 .terraform/ (folder)&#xa;2 .terraform.lock.hcl (file)&#xa;2 terraform validate&#xa;Koi file create nahi hoti&#xa;Kya karta h - 1 .tf file ka syntax check karta h&#xa;2 Error hai ya nahi batata h&#xa;3 terraform plan&#xa;Kya karta h -  1 Batata hai kya create/update/delete hoga&#xa;Kya banta h - 1 Normally koi file nahi banti&#xa;2 (Optional) agar tum command use karo&#xa;4 terraform apply&#xa;Kya karta h - 1 Kya karta h&#xa;Kya banta h - 1 terraform.tfstate (main state file)&#xa;2 terraform.tfstate.backup (backup file)&#xa;&#xa;" id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-9">
