        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Provider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Provider kya hota h  - &lt;/b&gt;Wo&lt;br&gt;tools/services jinke through&lt;br&gt;Terraform real world resources (jaise&lt;br&gt;AWS, Azure, GCP) se baat karta h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple -&lt;/b&gt; Provider - connection /&lt;br&gt;bridge&lt;br&gt;Terraform khud kuch create nahi&lt;br&gt;karta,&lt;br&gt;wo &lt;b&gt;providers ke through cloud&lt;br&gt;services se connect hoke&lt;br&gt;resources banata h&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Popular Providers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 AWS (Amazon Web Services)&lt;br&gt;2 Azure (Microsoft)&lt;br&gt;3 GCP (Google Cloud)&lt;br&gt;4 GitHub&lt;br&gt;5 Docker&lt;br&gt;Terraform ko cloud Se bate  krne k&lt;br&gt;liye provider ki zarurat padti h&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="335" x="2035" y="5520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: transparent; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Provider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;A Provider is a plugin that helps Terraform communicate with real-world platforms and services like AWS, Azure, and GCP.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple &lt;/b&gt;— a provider acts like a bridge between Terraform and cloud services.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Terraform itself cannot create resources directly.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;It uses providers to communicate with cloud platforms and manage infrastructure resources.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Popular Providers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;AWS (Amazon Web Services)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Azure (Microsoft Azure)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;GCP (Google Cloud Platform)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;GitHub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Docker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Terraform needs a provider to communicate with cloud services and create resources.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="640" width="330" x="2400" y="5520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Plugin&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10&quot; data-end=&quot;103&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;A plugin is a small software or add-on that increases the functionality of a main software.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple - &lt;/b&gt;a plugin adds extra features or capabilities to a software.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The main software is already working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The plugin adds new functionality or features to it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Plugin in Terraform&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;In Terraform, providers are called plugins.&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;AWS Provider → Plugin used to connect Terraform with AWS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Azure Provider → Plugin used to connect Terraform with Azure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-69fd758a-25d0-83e9-be3d-2be2da1a6a9f-0&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-14&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;e4d185ed-add3-452d-ac2c-b626620deea5&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;514&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Plugins help Terraform interact with different platforms and services.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mt-3 w-full empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;105&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="800" width="260" x="3020" y="5520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fa6800;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#C73500;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Plugin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Plugin kya hota h -&lt;/b&gt; Ek chhota&lt;br&gt;software/add-on jo kisi bade software ki&lt;br&gt;functionality ko badhata h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple - &lt;/b&gt; Plugin - extra feature add&lt;br&gt;karne wala tool&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mtlb - &lt;/b&gt;1 Main software already kaam&lt;br&gt;kar raha hota h&lt;br&gt;2 Plugin usme&lt;b&gt; naya kaam add karta h&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Terraform me plugin kya hota h?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Terraform me providers hi plugins hote h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Jaise -&lt;/b&gt; 1 AWS provider - AWS se&lt;br&gt;connect karne wala plugin&lt;br&gt;2 Azure provider - Azure se connect&lt;br&gt;karne wala plugin&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="640" width="240" x="2760" y="5520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;gradientColor=#d5739d;strokeColor=#996185;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Terraform Azure Workflow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 *Setup Phase*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;   * Sabse pehle *Terraform install* kiya&lt;br&gt;   * Uske baad *VS Code install* kiya&lt;br&gt;   * VS Code me *Terraform Extension (plugin)* install kiya&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2 *Provider Code Setup*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Terraform *Azure provider ka code* registry se copy kiya&lt;br&gt;   * .tf file me paste kiya&lt;br&gt;   * Yeh file hi *infrastructure as code (IaC)* ka base hoti h.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 *Terraform Init (Game Changer)*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Command: *terraform init*&lt;br&gt;   * Yeh kya karta hai:&lt;br&gt;     * Current folder me sab *.tf files scan* karta hai&lt;br&gt;     * *Provider block identify* karta hai&lt;br&gt;     * Required provider ko *Terraform Registry se download* karta hai&lt;br&gt;     * Local me .terraform folder create karta hai&lt;br&gt;     * Ek *.terraform.lock.hcl file* banata hai jisme *provider version lock* hota&lt;br&gt;hai&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;   * Important:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;     * Version upgrade ke liye simple init nahi chalega&lt;br&gt;     * Use: *terraform init -upgrade*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4 *Provider Block Configuration*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Azure ke liye:&lt;br&gt;     hcl&lt;br&gt;     provider &quot;azurerm&quot; {&lt;br&gt;       features {}&lt;br&gt;     }&lt;br&gt;     &lt;br&gt;   * Yaha:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     * *azurerm* = Azure Resource Manager provider&lt;br&gt;     * *features {}* = mandatory argument (basic features enable karta hai)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5 *Terraform Fmt (Formatting)*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Command: *terraform fmt*&lt;br&gt;   * Code ko *proper format / indentation* me laata hai&lt;br&gt;   * Clean &amp;amp; readable banata hai (interview me impress karega )&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6 *Terraform Validate (Syntax Check)*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Command: *terraform validate*&lt;br&gt;   * Yeh check karta hai:&lt;br&gt;     * Syntax sahi hai ya nahi&lt;br&gt;     * Koi *error / misconfiguration* hai ya nahi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7 *Terraform Plan (Preview Mode)*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Command: *terraform plan*&lt;br&gt;   * Yeh batata hai:&lt;br&gt;     * Kya *create hoga (+)*&lt;br&gt;     * Kya *update hoga (~)*&lt;br&gt;     * Kya *delete hoga (-)*&lt;br&gt;   *  Basically ek *execution blueprint* deta hai before actual apply&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8 *Terraform Apply (Execution )*&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;   * Command: *terraform apply*&lt;br&gt;   * Yeh karta hai:&lt;br&gt;     * *Plan + Execution dono*&lt;br&gt;     * Actual me resources create/update/delete karta hai&lt;br&gt;   * Apply ke baad:&lt;br&gt;     * Azure portal me *Resource Group (RG)* ban jayega&lt;br&gt;     * Har resource ka ek *unique Resource ID* hota hai&lt;br&gt;    *Short Interview Line (Power Punch)&lt;br&gt; *Terraform init provider download karta hai, fmt code format karta hai,&lt;br&gt;validate syntax check karta hai, plan preview deta hai aur apply actual&lt;br&gt;infrastructure create karta hai.*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1960" width="560" x="40" y="6240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-17" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#fff2cc;gradientColor=#ffd966;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 Azure Exe -&lt;/b&gt; 300&lt;br&gt;resource&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2 Aws Exe -&lt;/b&gt; 500&lt;br&gt;resource&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 GCP Exe -&lt;/b&gt; 250&lt;br&gt;resources&lt;br&gt;Specific cloud ki&lt;br&gt;jo  exe hoti h usko&lt;br&gt;hum log terraform&lt;br&gt;provider bolte h&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
