        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Terraform .Exe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Terraform .exe kya hota h -&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; &lt;b&gt;Terraform EXE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ek&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;executable file&lt;/b&gt; hoti h (Windows me .exe), jisse hum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Terraform commands run karte h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple - &lt;/b&gt;1 terraform.exe - Terraform ka &lt;b&gt;main program&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; Isi file se hum commands chalate hain jaise&lt;br&gt;1 terraform init&lt;br&gt;2 terraform validate&lt;br&gt;3 terraform plan&lt;br&gt;4 terraform apply&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex -&lt;/b&gt; 1 Jab tum Terraform download karte ho, to&lt;br&gt;tumhe ek file milti h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;terraform.exe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2 Agar CMD ya PowerShell me likhte h&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;terraform init&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actually ye command &lt;b&gt;terraform.exe hi run kar raha&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;hota h.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Easy - jaise&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 chrome.exe - Chrome open karta h&lt;br&gt;2  terraform.exe  Terraform run karta h&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" link="&#xa;Terraform .Exe&#xa;Terraform .exe kya hota h - Terraform EXE ek&#xa;executable file hoti h (Windows me .exe), jisse hum&#xa;Terraform commands run karte h&#xa;Simple - 1 terraform.exe - Terraform ka main&#xa;program&#xa; Isi file se hum commands chalate hain jaise&#xa;1 terraform init&#xa;2 terraform validate&#xa;3 terraform plan&#xa;4 terraform apply&#xa;Ex - 1 Jab tum Terraform download karte ho, to&#xa;tumhe ek file milti h&#xa;terraform.exe&#xa;2 Agar CMD ya PowerShell me likhte h&#xa;terraform init&#xa;Actually ye command terraform.exe hi run kar raha&#xa;hota h&#xa;Easy - jaise&#xa;1 chrome.exe - Chrome open karta h&#xa;2  terraform.exe  Terraform run karta h&#xa;&#xa;" id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-51">
