        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-55" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Terraform .Exe&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Terraform.exe is an executable file used to run Terraform commands on Windows.&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple -&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;code data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;131&quot;&gt;terraform.exe&lt;/code&gt; is the main Terraform program.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Using this file, we can run commands like&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;1&amp;nbsp;terraform init&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;terraform validate&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;terraform plan&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;4&amp;nbsp;terraform apply&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;When we download Terraform, we get a file called&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;terraform.exe&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;When we run a command in CMD or PowerShell like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;terraform init&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Actually, the &lt;code data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot;&gt;terraform.exe&lt;/code&gt; file is running in the background.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Easy Understanding&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;590&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;chrome.exe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Opens Google Chrome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;code data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;644&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;terraform.exe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Runs Terraform commands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="680" width="400" x="2880" y="6360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-56" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcd28;gradientColor=#ffa500;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Azurerm .Exe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Azurem .exe kya hota h - &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; azurerm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;exe koi alag software nahi hota - ye&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;actually Terraform ka Azure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;provider hota h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple -&lt;/b&gt; azurerm = Azure Resource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Manager provider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Ye Terraform ko help karta hai taaki&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;tum &lt;b&gt;Microsoft Azure&lt;/b&gt; ke resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;create/manage kar sako&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;jaise -&lt;/b&gt; 1 Virtual Machine (VM)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2 Storage Account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3 Resource Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;.exe kyu bolte hain?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Jab tum Windows use karti ho,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Terraform providers &lt;b&gt;background me&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ek executable file (.exe)&lt;/b&gt; ke form me&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;download hote h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - &lt;/b&gt;1 jab tum terraform init run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;karti ho&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2 to azurerm provider &lt;b&gt;automatically&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;download hota h&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3 aur system me .terraform folder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ke andar .exe file ban jati h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Short -&lt;/b&gt; 1 azurerm → Azure ka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Terraform provider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2 .exe → uska Windows executable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;file (auto download hota h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3 Tumhe manually install karne ki&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;zarurat nahi hoti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
