        <mxCell id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-57" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Azurerm.Exe&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;28&quot;&gt;azurerm.exe&lt;/code&gt; is not a separate software.&lt;br data-start=&quot;56&quot; data-end=&quot;59&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;It is actually the Azure provider used by Terraform.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;15&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Simple -&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;132&quot; data-end=&quot;141&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;azurerm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; stands for Azure Resource Manager provider.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;It helps Terraform connect with Microsoft Azure to create and manage resources such as&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Virtual Machines (VMs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Storage Accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Resource Groups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why is it called &lt;code data-start=&quot;369&quot; data-end=&quot;375&quot;&gt;.exe&lt;/code&gt;?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;In Windows, Terraform providers are downloaded as executable (&lt;code data-start=&quot;440&quot; data-end=&quot;446&quot;&gt;.exe&lt;/code&gt;) files in the background.&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;When we run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;terraform init&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Terraform automatically downloads the AzureRM provider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The provider executable file gets stored inside the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;660&quot; data-end=&quot;672&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.terraform&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; folder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Short Explanation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;716&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;azurerm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Azure provider for Terraform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;753&quot; data-end=&quot;759&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.exe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Windows executable file of the provider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;It is downloaded automatically, so no manual installation is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="920" width="463" x="1120" y="6880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Block k andar Block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Block k andr blck kya hota h -&lt;/b&gt; Block&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ke andar block ko nested block kehte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;hain, jo main resource ke andar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;additional configuration define karta h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple -&lt;/b&gt; Jab ek block ke andar ek aur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;block likhte hain, use nested block bolte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - &lt;/b&gt;resource &quot;aws_instance&quot; &quot;example&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ami = &quot;ami-123456&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;instance_type = &quot;t2.micro&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;tags {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1 resource - main (parent) block&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2 tags - uske andar ka &lt;b&gt;child (nested)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Means - &lt;/b&gt;Block ke andar jo dusra block&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;hota hai = nested block&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Easy Ex-&lt;/b&gt; Ghar (main block)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Ghar ke andar rooms (nested blocks)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&#xa;Block k andar Block &#xa;Block k andr blck kya hota h - Block&#xa;ke andar block ko nested block kehte&#xa;hain, jo main resource ke andar&#xa;additional configuration define karta h&#xa;Simple - Jab ek block ke andar ek aur&#xa;block likhte hain, use nested block bolte&#xa;h&#xa;Ex - resource &quot;aws_instance&quot; &quot;example&quot;&#xa;{&#xa;ami = &quot;ami-123456&quot;&#xa;instance_type = &quot;t2.micro&quot;&#xa;tags {&#xa;1 resource - main (parent) block&#xa;2 tags - uske andar ka child (nested)&#xa;block&#xa;Means - Block ke andar jo dusra block&#xa;hota hai = nested block&#xa;Easy Ex- Ghar (main block)&#xa;Ghar ke andar rooms (nested blocks)&#xa;&#xa;" id="y5oC0jycFWUP5E_PDjlG-58">
