        <mxCell id="kuPGtM-lms9-EqfliVAR-2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Dynamic Value&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What is a Dynamic Value?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;A dynamic value is a value that is not fixed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;It can change according to the situation or requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple Difference&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;178&quot; data-end=&quot;194&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Static Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; = Always same&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;214&quot; data-end=&quot;231&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Dynamic Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; = Can change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex - 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Static Value&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;instance_type = &quot;t2.micro&quot; (&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Here, the value is fixed as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;362&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&quot;t2.micro&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Dynamic Value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;instance_type = var.instance_type (&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Here, the value is coming from a variable.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;It can be&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;1&amp;nbsp;t2.micro&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;t2.small&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;So this is called a dynamic value.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Advantages of Dynamic Values&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Code becomes reusable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Same code can be used in multiple places&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Values can be changed easily&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Hardcoding is avoided&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
