        <mxCell id="kuPGtM-lms9-EqfliVAR-73" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b1ddf0;strokeColor=#10739e;fontSize=20;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Looping in Terraform&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Looping in Terraform kya hota h ?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ek hi code ko multiple times automatically run karna.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Isse baar baar same code likhne ki zarurat nahi padti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Short Interview Answer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Looping in Terraform is used to create multiple resources automatically using a single block of code. Terraform mainly uses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;1409&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;count&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;1421&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;for_each&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; for looping.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Looping ke Advantages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Repeated code kam hota hai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Time save hota hai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Code reusable banta hai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Easy management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Advantages of Looping&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Repeated code is reduced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;It saves time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;3&amp;nbsp;Code becomes reusable&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;4&amp;nbsp;Resources are easy to manage&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ex -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Maan lo aapko 3 EC2 instances banana hain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Without loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;resource &quot;aws_instance&quot; &quot;server1&quot; {}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;resource &quot;aws_instance&quot; &quot;server2&quot; {}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;Bahut repetitive code ho gaya.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;With Loop -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;resource &quot;aws_instance&quot; &quot;server&quot; {&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; count = 3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;}&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Yaha Terraform automatically 3 instances bana dega.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;Yehi looping hai.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1360" width="415" x="1910" y="1560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
